---
// A Typical Day section for Life at Teknoppy with draggable horizontal filmstrip, office details, and interactive map card
---

<section id="day" style="padding-top:20px;scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center sec">
      <span class="tag">A typical day</span>
      <h2 class="words">What does a day at the Teknoppy office look like?</h2>
      <p>Our office is on the second floor of Kaithakal Building in Thykoodam, Vyttila, a short walk from Thykoodam Metro. Most days follow a rhythm like this.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Draggable Filmstrip with Animated Sprocket Holes -->
    <div class="film rv">
      <div class="frames" id="frames" role="region" aria-label="Timeline of a typical day at Teknoppy">
        <div class="frame">
          <time>9:30 am</time>
          <b>Stand-up</b>
          <span>Ten minutes on what's shipping today, blockers, and who needs a hand.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <time>10:00 am</time>
          <b>Focused work</b>
          <span>Builds, site audits and content planning. Headphones on, notifications off.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="frame photo">
          <div class="frame-photo-wrap">
            <img src="/images/life/teknoppy-studio-work.webp" alt="Teknoppy team during daily sprint work" class="frame-photo-img" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="frame-photo-overlay">
              <span class="fpo-tag">Sprint Floor</span>
              <span class="fpo-desc">Daily tasks & sprint focus</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <time>12:00 pm</time>
          <b>Reviews</b>
          <span>Seniors go through junior code, schema and design side by side, not over email.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="frame photo">
          <div class="frame-photo-wrap">
            <img src="/images/life/teknoppy-team-collaboration.webp" alt="Teknoppy engineers doing side-by-side peer review" class="frame-photo-img" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="frame-photo-overlay">
              <span class="fpo-tag">Peer Reviews</span>
              <span class="fpo-desc">Side-by-side code & design review</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <time>1:00 pm</time>
          <b>Lunch together</b>
          <span>Most of us eat together in the office. Team discussions, tea and recharge.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <time>2:00 pm</time>
          <b>Client calls & consultations</b>
          <span>Scoping and ranking review calls on Gulf time for UAE & Qatar accounts, plus face-to-face studio meetings.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="frame photo">
          <div class="frame-photo-wrap">
            <img src="/images/life/teknoppy-client-consultation-lenaa.webp" alt="Client strategy discussion in Teknoppy studio lounge" class="frame-photo-img" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="frame-photo-overlay">
              <span class="fpo-tag">Consultations</span>
              <span class="fpo-desc">Strategy & client roadmaps</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <time>5:00 pm</time>
          <b>Wrap-up</b>
          <span>Rankings checked, analytics updated, commits merged, and tomorrow planned.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="filmhint">Drag or swipe through the day →</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Office Location Details & Animated Schematic Map -->
    <div class="place">
      <div class="info rv">
        <div>
          <small>Address</small>
          Second Floor, Kaithakal Building, Door No 49, Kaithakal Lane, Thykoodam, Vyttila, Kochi, Kerala 682019
        </div>
        <div>
          <small>Getting here</small>
          A short 3-minute walk from Thykoodam Metro Station (Exit A).
        </div>
        <div>
          <small>Working days</small>
          Monday to Saturday, 9:30 am to 5:30 pm
        </div>
        <div>
          <small>Visiting</small>
          Clients and prospective candidates are welcome by appointment. Call <a href="tel:+916282249224">+91 6282249224</a>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Map Card with SVG Dash Animation -->
      <a
        href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Teknoppy+Web+Design+Kochi" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="map rv" 
        style="--d:1"
        aria-label="View Teknoppy office on Google Maps"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M30,260 C120,240 140,170 200,150"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="mlabel">Thykoodam Metro → Teknoppy Office</span>
        <span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <b>Open Teknoppy Studio on Google Maps ↗</b>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .frame-photo-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .frame-photo-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .frame.photo:hover .frame-photo-img {
    transform: scale(1.06);
  }
  .frame-photo-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 40%, rgba(26,26,26,0.8) 100%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 16px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .fpo-tag {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    background: rgba(26,26,26,0.8);
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .fpo-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .map {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .map:hover b {
    color: var(--orange);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
</style>
